cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Arc-Mirror"
message: "If you use this software or computational results, please cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Omidiran"
    given-names: "Favour Daniel"
    affiliation: "Federal University of Petroleum Resources, Effurun (FUPRE), Nigeria"
repository-code: "https://github.com/omidiranfavourdaniel-2009/arc-mirror-theory"
abstract: >-
  Computational tools for Arc-Mirror reflector geometry, adaptive circular-arc
  segmentation, CNC G02/G03 toolpath generation, optical ray tracing, and
  first-order thermal-expansion sensitivity analysis. The repository supports
  the 2 m, f/D = 1.5 solar-dish case study developed for the IAS Global Energy
  Hackathon 2026.
keywords:
  - Arc-Mirror
  - solar thermal
  - parabolic reflector
  - concentrated solar power
  - circular arc approximation
  - CNC
  - ray tracing
  - thermal analysis
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-04
